 markAsTouched?\n\n```ts\noptional markAsTouched?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types.public.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/types.public.ts#L12)\n\nWhether to mark the field as touched from the update.\n\n#### Default\n\n```ts\ntrue\n```\n"}
